OL,3,GNEWSAMajor sea angling competition
OL,4,Areturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Yorkshire is to host a European
OL,7,Fsea angling competition.
OL,9,FCompetitors will take to the coast next
OL,10,FMarch for the Paul Roggeman European
OL,11,FOpen Beach Championship.
OL,13,FTickets for the three-day event have
OL,14,Fgone on sale, with juniors being
OL,15,Fallowed to compete for overall
OL,16,Fchampionship for the first time.
OL,18,FEast Riding councillor Nick Coultish
OL,19,Fsaid the event would "play a key role
OL,20,Fin supporting local economies in early
OL,21,F2027".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
